sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Caller
    participant CB as Circuit breaker
    participant Rt as Retry with backoff
    participant Svc as Downstream service
    participant Fb as Fallback
    C->>CB: request
    alt circuit closed
        CB->>Rt: allow
        Rt->>Svc: attempt 1
        alt succeeds
            Svc-->>C: response
        else fails and is retryable
            Rt->>Rt: wait with jitter
            Note over Rt: jitter stops every client retrying in lockstep
            Rt->>Svc: attempt 2
            alt still failing
                Rt->>CB: record failure
                CB->>CB: threshold crossed — open the circuit
                CB->>Fb: serve degraded
                Fb-->>C: cached or default response
            end
        end
    else circuit open
        CB->>Fb: shed immediately, do not pile on
        Fb-->>C: degraded response
        Note over CB: after a cooldown a probe decides whether to close
    end
